        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "I recently had 5 large wool carpets cleaned and I couldn’t be happier with the results. They were delivered in a great condition which truly exceeded all expectations. One of my Persian carpets had not been cleaned in 30 years and I am thrilled with how it looks. Most had pet stains and I am amazed that they came back looking and smelling so clean. I HIGHLY RECOMMEND!!!!!",
        "time": 1753650713,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Linda McGurk",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103048161967561785288/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVEK_Yz3A-h1k7xGpyS7SwO5MPPr2ULIDjSZj9Zc8v-bEcqhXY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "Jones Multinet excels in quality and service. I have had both furniture and carpets cleaned by them and the results were exceptional. Service is friendly and extremely efficient. Highly recommend them.",
        "time": 1747859571,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Paige S",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113063807357920210455/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVI5V60nSeXwpy1yyj9vO8aHZQmtcMDIBuSjoOfVSgfT_9swPAs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I would definitely recommend Dave to anyone for carpet cleaning. He did our entire basement. He was friendly, knowledgeable, punctual and used pet/kid friendly products. Basement looks clean and smells fantastic. Thanks for the great service and we'll see you around the same time next year 😊",
        "time": 1694613817,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jeff McMurdo",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112544742298351206549/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKwKGKDUeRZ-7m9QoO_z1HYerQxlcNrTMEGTj3RayxHkzwn=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Very punctual, professional and honest, truly rare qualities in today’s marketplace.\nOur carpets were cleaned professionally with no issues. Dave is very knowledgeable and didn’t ever try to sell products or services that weren’t necessary. The entire process from estimation,to actual visit to do the cleaning, was very friendly and pleasant. I highly recommend this business for your cleaning needs. I will definitely be using them in the future.",
        "time": 1624289506,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "A Leal",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107519869212339853098/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocITPGTWlvXMF6762pj3eikfP-LYSBamvyM-Q40ttBcv9Sq1w6Le=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Our basement carpet needed pet odor removal and Dave did an excellent job cleaning it.  We are very happy with their service.  They were punctual and very professional and the carpet was cleaned and free of odor.  I would highly recommend their service.  We will definitely use them again.  Thanks Dave!",
